WEBVTT

00:09:57.718 --> 00:10:01.305
and you say, “Their wins
have nothing to do with my worthiness.”

00:10:01.764 --> 00:10:04.141
And then you’re ready to give a note.

00:10:04.975 --> 00:10:06.977
You go on social media,

00:10:06.977 --> 00:10:08.520
and you say congratulations.

00:10:08.604 --> 00:10:10.064
Or my personal favorite,

00:10:10.064 --> 00:10:13.275
you pick up the phone,
like it’s the 20th century,

00:10:13.275 --> 00:10:14.777
and you say, “Congratulations,

00:10:14.777 --> 00:10:16.737
kudos, you did that, Al!

00:10:16.737 --> 00:10:17.738
You go, girl!”

00:10:17.738 --> 00:10:18.989
You do all the things.

00:10:19.281 --> 00:10:22.409
Instantly you feel
like a better human being

00:10:22.409 --> 00:10:25.579
because you have actually extended grace.

00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:27.706
You’ve extended grace.

00:10:27.706 --> 00:10:30.459
You’ve extended grace to someone else.